          "reason": "The statement is an attainment and maximality theorem, not an iff characterization."
        }
      ],
      "finite_checks": [
        {
          "check": "For K={0,1}, a(0)=0, a(1)=1, and prescribed mean x=1/2, the only feasible weights are 1/2,1/2; the minimum is 1/2 with two atoms.",
          "evidence": "Substitute into the finite barycenter and energy sums in steps 2.1 and 4.1."
