          "claim": "For bounded observable $B$, the trace-class ideal and trace estimates in [F2] and [F4] give $|\\operatorname{Tr}((\\bar\\rho_T-\\rho_{\\rm diag})B)|\\le\\|\\bar\\rho_T-\\rho_{\\rm diag}\\|_1\\|B\\|$. Step 6.1 sends the right-hand side to zero. The conclusion is only convergence of time-averaged states in the stated trace norm.",
          "step": "7.1",
          "inputs": [
